=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TbxTtcZ5jR8Q7kNvwEr02Hz&_nc_oc=AdobCCBNF-rQq93jF8X2ffXPQiZvVXlzoQN_zzw2_oES7rq9IULvkli_mTkmdcdfvvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRU3Cxcwd2NapdG2cTVtTo1C56NWV_R7EnSGy7DpHHbg&oe=6AF88CAF"}, {"file_name": "boss1_b.png", "id": "2114580446102019", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301196_2114580449435352_8110243903589022422_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fZMwFrZEKGYQ7kNvwFxNcmL&_nc_oc=Adpdh8IhuhOIlL_3q8MLEYU3_gRUE6X-tnN-lHN1YodXCztl6pcBHWMP_9jflu5DHJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5R1VYQPlMwMSeN0xH_rqUVM9kTNCdP1zuw8enr35LXA&oe=6AF8808A"}, {"file_name": "premiumTerror6_a.png", "id": "1009333898541854", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293690_1009333901875187_7157437501160380750_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S_xp0JQtvPUQ7kNvwGjYD_g&_nc_oc=AdoYDX9Gl1woULNG1fyR2hN3raGWMK5JUTTeWABcik2R0yQpcQLsAQfY_hQ8mfVtn60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-QVriEEUJHrHHi1eFoA1vVeMDzkKdvjhpiTq6If-t7A&oe=6AF898DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "2111651943108109", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_2111651946441442_4760822448506905154_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gP3A78lT8T8Q7kNvwF-O5tN&_nc_oc=AdpHMGstux2gd9xuL0GuyZwxzqIKC9GUTSAJM8WA2uks8wcBZvD64zc2g2bsaAqZ1LQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-mZlleLMJNhFjBU4Y2jpBx1v43rRa4LpziOfI7Jz7kA&oe=6AF88977"}, "display_name": "Labyrinth ZERO VR", "keywords": ["terror", "scary"], "long_description": "You wake inside Labyrinth Zero: a place that rebuilds itself behind your back, where the only light is the one in your hand.\n\nEVERY FEAR HAS ITS OWN ROOM Ten psychological horror scenarios that escalate from unease to panic: total darkness, whispering radios, figures that only move when you stop looking at them.\n\nA CITY IN THE FOG Walk streets swallowed by the mist and realize something has been following you. Find the hidden bombs and set traps before it reaches you.\n\nFOUR BOSSES, FOUR WAYS TO DIE The Mutant only understands the language of the pipe. The Scavenger hunts you through a fog maze. The Lizard can't even be touched: turn its own charge against it. And the armored Crab only bleeds while its claw is stuck in the sand.\n\nTHE STATION No weapons. No tricks. Just an endless platform and something that never stops walking toward you.\n\n\u2022 Full 3D spatial audio: hear exactly where it comes from \u2022 Physical flashlight, grabbable objects and melee combat \u2022 A score system that unlocks new zones \u2022 Voices and text in English and Spanish \u2022 Different music and scares on every run\n\nLabyrinth Zero is not a corridor of jump scares: it is a place that learns how you get scared. Walk in with your flashlight charged.", "short_description": "The dark is not empty. Lose yourself in breathing labyrinths, a fog-swallowed city and a station nobody ever leaves, armed with nothing but your flashlight. Ten psychological nightmares, bomb hunts and four colossal bosses that never fall to luck: learn their patterns or become their prey. Full 3D spatial audio, scares that close in around you, and voices in English and Spanish. In Labyrinth Zero, terror doesn't chase you... it waits for you. Dare to turn on the light?\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2162991891321246", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Labyrinth Zero VR", "keywords": ["terror", "panic"], "long_description": "Despiertas en el Laberinto Cero: un lugar que se reconstruye a tu espalda, donde la \u00fanica luz es la que llevas en la mano.\n\nCADA MIEDO TIENE SU PROPIA HABITACI\u00d3N Diez escenarios de terror psicol\u00f3gico que escalan de la inquietud al p\u00e1nico: oscuridad total, radios que susurran, figuras que solo avanzan cuando dejas de mirarlas.\n\nUNA CIUDAD EN LA NIEBLA Recorre calles devoradas por la bruma y descubre que algo te sigue. Busca las bombas ocultas y ti\u00e9ndele trampas antes de que te alcance.\n\nCUATRO JEFES, CUATRO FORMAS DE MORIR El Mutante solo entiende el idioma del tubo. El Carro\u00f1ero te caza en un laberinto de niebla. Al Lagarto no puedes ni tocarlo: vuelve su embestida en su contra. Y el Cangrejo acorazado solo sangra cuando su pinza queda clavada en la arena.\n\nLA ESTACI\u00d3N Sin armas. Sin trucos. Solo un and\u00e9n interminable y algo que no deja de caminar hacia ti.\n\n\u2022 Audio espacial 3D: escucha exactamente de d\u00f3nde viene \u2022 Linterna f\u00edsica, objetos agarrables y combate cuerpo a cuerpo \u2022 Sistema de puntos que desbloquea nuevas zonas \u2022 Voces y textos en espa\u00f1ol e ingl\u00e9s \u2022 M\u00fasica y sustos distintos en cada partida\n\nLabyrinth Zero no es un pasillo de sustos: es un lugar que aprende c\u00f3mo te asustas. Entra con la linterna cargada.", "short_description": "La oscuridad no est\u00e1 vac\u00eda. Pi\u00e9rdete en laberintos que respiran, una ciudad tragada por la niebla y una estaci\u00f3n de la que nadie vuelve, armado solo con tu linterna. Diez pesadillas psicol\u00f3gicas, cacer\u00edas con bombas y cuatro jefes colosales que no caen por suerte: aprende sus patrones o convi\u00e9rtete en su presa. Audio espacial 3D, sustos que te rodean y voces en espa\u00f1ol e ingl\u00e9s. En Labyrinth Zero el terror no te persigue... te espera. \u00bfTe atreves a encender la linterna?\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/be2cbb61-48bb-45f3-ad68-6fe0e6d7690f", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Teran Almazan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/be2cbb61-48bb-45f3-ad68-6fe0e6d7690f", "category": null, "comfort_rati